{%- comment -%}
  Creator reels per language (05.11.2026): the reels speak one language, so a page
  shows only the reels set to the page's language (request.locale, served by Shopify
  itself: /nl-nl/ and /nl-be/ = nl, /fr-be/ = fr). One check for every reel spot:
  homepage row (ugc-home-row), Bundle & Save carousel (pm-bs-ugc-grid), collection
  grid tiles (main-collection-product-grid) and the product page row (ugc-video-count).

  Accepts:
  - lang: {String} the block's "language" setting: nl, fr, en or all (blank = nl,
    the setting's default, so reels placed before 05.11.2026 count as Dutch)

  Prints:
  - 1       show the reel
  - editor  not this page's language, but the theme editor is open: show it with a
            tag (snippets/ugc-lang-tag) so it can still be edited
  - 0       leave the reel out of the page

  Usage:
  {%- capture ugc_ok -%}{% render 'ugc-lang-match', lang: block.settings.language %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign ugc_ok = ugc_ok | strip -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign reel_lang = lang | default: 'nl' | downcase
  assign page_lang = request.locale.iso_code | slice: 0, 2 | downcase
  if reel_lang == 'all' or reel_lang == page_lang
    echo '1'
  elsif request.design_mode
    echo 'editor'
  else
    echo '0'
  endif
-%}
